[quote="VisforYoshi"]
 By the way, Something I havent seen pointed out yet here: Omni-U&#39;s base power plus hasty augmentation effects the damage for every single card that&#39;s destroyed... Every. Single. Instance. So if you use that and then play singularity to destroy everything, you get a glorious nuke to end all nukes 

[/quote]

I don&#39;t know that that works. It&#39;s not the power itself that is dealing damage, it&#39;s the card destruction.

&nbsp;

EDIT: Nope, I&#39;m wrong. I tested it in the video game and provided you play a destruction card during the power it does give the extra +2 damage. it does not do so if the destruction happens after that point.

&nbsp;

DOUBLE EDIT: Which seems wonky to me. Either it should deal the extra damage or it should not, it should not matter when the destruction occurs.

&nbsp;

TRIPLE EDIT: The uses of the power stacks as well, so using your base power on your turn, Grandpa Legacy&#39;s turn and then on Unity with Hasty Augmentation results in 3 lots of 4 damage for each Equipment card destroyed. Which has got to be a bug.
